  "goodToKnow": "Die Unsterblichkeit is immortality: die Unsterblichkeit der Seele. Unsterblich means immortal, and colloquially it intensifies: sich unsterblich verlieben (to fall madly in love), sich unsterblich blamieren (to make a total fool of oneself). The mythical jellyfish Turritopsis dohrnii is called die unsterbliche Qualle because it can revert to a younger stage. It has no plural."
